<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch-functions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Functions</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces the concept of functions and their properties.
      We explore functions in general.
      Then we look at specific types of functions, such as quadratic functions and polynomial functions.
      Additionally, we discuss the graphical representation of functions and their transformations.
    </p>
  </introduction>;

